  "scope": "Hosted GitHub Actions run 39857550512, job 120100087128, artifact 12460139373 rebuilt the result-only ordinary-source dotnet package selection. The author routes reproduce the package, remove author sources, install without network access and replay unchanged typed callers. The standalone result-only API exposes Lean-produced proof-free dependent results without checked-input metadata. The retained archive authenticates every original artifact byte, route result, package, caller observation and selected source. Hosted dependent checked-record acceptance covers only the retained top-level copied DependentRecords.Dependent parameter and result sites, whose Fin bound field depends on the runtime bound field and whose proof is rebuilt by the selected mkDependent constructor. Full packages cover parameters and results; standalone result-only packages cover results only. Dependent fields of other kinds, nested or recursive dependent records, checked-record fields, callbacks, owned positions, open or opaque indices and zero-payload records remain unreviewed here. The PHP-Wasm cells are the shared result tracked by #1461 and are not inferred from native PHP. External runtimes, compilers, package managers and operating-system distributions remain trusted recorded inputs.",
